      <title>Bitcoin Rallies Back as Tech Rebound Sparks Speculative Appetite</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-21/bitcoin-rallies-back-as-tech-rebound-sparks-speculative-appetite</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b2d9dd3dc376ddc8b54abcec</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:15:49 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Bitcoin climbed alongside technology stocks as a revival in risk appetite spread to cryptocurrencies, lifting the token out of a bout of listless trading and offering another sign of resurgent speculative fervor across global markets.</description>
